<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19716" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βδέω</span></b> , poet. aor.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βδέσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					11.242
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Nicarch.
			</span></i>); later 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔβδευσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hierocl.
					<u>Facet.</u>
					233
				</span></i>
			, al.:—<i>break wind</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pl.</u>
				693
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Pax</u>
				151
			</span></i>, etc.: c. acc. cogn., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ λιβανωτὸν βδέω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Pl.</u>
					703
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			 or 
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				900
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of the
			cockroach, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σίλφης κατοικιδίου τῆς βδεούσης τὸ
					στέαρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Archig.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				8.35
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				12.861
			</span></i>. (Onomatopoeic word: root <i>bzd</i>, cf. Czech
			<i>bzditi</i>, Slov. <i>pezdēti</i>, Lat.
				<i>pēdo.</i>)</div>
